  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Regional Blue Carbon Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment, implemented by Conservation International, in collaboration with local stakeholders and government partners, aims to protect and manage blue carbon ecosystems in the Pacific. It aims to strengthen blue carbon expertise and data in the Pacific; support the integration of blue carbon into national greenhouse gas accounting and climate policy; and encourage investment in blue carbon restoration and conservation projects. Investment activities include support for mangrove restoration, carbon trading and national policy support.</narrative>
  </description>
